Walk from one end of Toronto to the other: from The Besches to High Park for the ultimate hot girl walk. 

I’ve always wanted to do this epic Toronto walk, and I honestly think that it’s the best scenic route that brings you through some pretty incredible neighborhoods! From coffee and shopping in Leslieville, through the financial district and even up through the Ossington strip. I would definitely do this walking route again! 

